    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The water was so cold, and I called for them, but they didn\u2019t come.
    But now, Teddy is back. A new one, just like before, from Mommy and Daddy. They
    didn\u2019t hate me. They still love me. Maybe\u2026 they were just scared too."
