    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "But now, as I unwrap the warm burger in my hands, the scent filling the
    emptiness, I finally have what I longed for. With every bite, I taste not just
    the food, but their love\u2014the love that never left me, even after everything."
