    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "I thought leaving would bring peace\u2014to them, to me. But I was wrong.
    My parents\u2019 letter arrived too late, yet their words still reached me: You
    are loved. If only I had known before the silence took me."
