    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "[Died of Illness]\nThe sickness took so much\u2014my strength, my freedom,
    even the smallest joys. I begged for just one bite of McDonald\u2019s, but my
    parents only shook their heads, loving me too much to take the risk. "
